# URLs skipped by the link checks (lychee) and the repository audit
# (scripts/health_report.py, scripts/maint/). One regex per line.
# Every pattern needs a reason above it; prefer fixing the link over adding one.

# Citation of an FAQ in GooseMod's archived wiki, not a listed tool.
^https://github\.com/GooseMod/GooseMod/wiki/

# Dead upstreams named on purpose in the descriptions of their maintained forks.
^https://github\.com/hooram/ownphotos
^https://github\.com/maybe-finance/maybe

# The dSheets app answers every request with HTTP 500 but works in a browser.
^https://sheets\.fileverse\.io
